<h1>Post a design contest</h1>
<p class="muted">Describe the tattoo design you want. Designers submit entries for 7 days, then you pick a winner. The prize is paid up front and held in escrow — the winner gets the prize minus a 12% platform fee.</p>

<form method="post" action="/contests">
  <input type="text" name="website" class="hp" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off" aria-hidden="true">

  <div>
    <label for="contest-title">Title</label>
    <input type="text" id="contest-title" name="title" required maxlength="120" placeholder="e.g. Neo-traditional wolf sleeve panel">
  </div>

  <div>
    <label for="contest-desc">The brief — what should designers draw?</label>
    <textarea id="contest-desc" name="description" required rows="6" maxlength="4000" placeholder="Subject, mood, must-haves, must-avoids…"></textarea>
  </div>

  <div class="two-col">
    <div>
      <label for="contest-style">Style</label>
      <select id="contest-style" name="style">
        <option value="">Any style</option>
        <% styles.forEach(function(s) { %><option value="<%= s %>"><%= s %></option><% }); %>
      </select>
    </div>
    <div>
      <label for="contest-placement">Size / placement</label>
      <input type="text" id="contest-placement" name="size_placement" maxlength="200" placeholder="e.g. Forearm, ~6 inches tall">
    </div>
  </div>

  <div>
    <label for="contest-prize">Prize (minimum <%= money(minPrize) %>)</label>
    <select id="contest-prize" name="prize_cents" required>
      <% suggestions.forEach(function(s, i) { %>
      <option value="<%= s.prize %>"<%= i === 0 ? ' selected' : '' %>><%= money(s.prize) %> prize — <%= money(s.quote.totalCents) %> total incl. fee</option>
      <% }); %>
    </select>
    <p class="muted">The prize is charged now (plus the 3.5% + $0.49 processing fee) and held in escrow. If no one enters, it's refunded to your site credit.</p>
  </div>

  <p><button class="btn" type="submit">Post contest &amp; pay prize</button></p>
</form>
<p class="muted">All contest sales are final once a winner is picked. Contest briefs are screened — no contact info or off-site payment mentions.</p>
